%rec: default
#FIELDS: id owner towards role at window performed absent
#
# An Obligation is a duty pointing either at another Townsperson or at the town.
# It is the only thing this simulation propagates: when someone goes Absent their
# Obligations are voided, offered to whoever they pointed at, then to anyone whose
# Role suits — and if nobody has the free hours, they go Unmet for good.
#
#   owner      who currently owes it
#   towards    who it is owed to; leave empty when it is owed to the town.
#              Reassignment tries this person first.
#   role       who may inherit it once the person above has been tried. Leave
#              empty and the duty dies with its holder.
#   window     HH:MM-HH:MM. Must not collide with the owner's Routine — the
#              Schedule resolves Obligations into the hours the Routine leaves free.
#   performed  what a watcher sees when it happens
#   absent     what the town looks like when it does not
#
# Author for consequence. Some duties should be absorbable, at least one should
# not be.

id: bread_for_mary
owner: hanno
towards: mary
role: farmer
at: 33,18
window: 16:00-17:00
performed: leaves a covered basket at the chapel door
absent: the chapel step is bare and the door stays shut

id: water_for_the_east_quarter
owner: hanno
role: farmer
at: 47,13
window: 17:00-18:00
performed: hauls two buckets from the well to the east quarter
absent: the east quarter's trough stands empty and cracking

id: shoe_the_draft_horses
owner: greta
role: smith
at: 20,6
window: 18:00-19:00
performed: works the forge late, the hammer audible across the square
absent: the forge is cold and the horses stay unshod

id: mend_the_chapel_roof
owner: abel
towards: mary
role: builder
at: 33,18
window: 17:00-18:00
performed: carries beams up a ladder against the chapel wall
absent: the ladder lies where it fell and the roof stays open

id: settle_the_market_disputes
owner: kirioth
towards: shekel
role: authority
at: 17,11
window: 08:00-09:00
performed: stands at the stalls hearing one trader out, then the other
absent: two traders shout past each other and nobody separates them

id: keep_the_ledger_of_the_dead
owner: mary
role: authority
at: 33,18
window: 13:00-15:00
performed: writes at length in a book kept beneath the altar
absent: the book lies open at the same page for days

id: unlock_the_town_gate
owner: shekel
at: 12,9
window: 05:00-06:00
performed: draws the bar off the gate before anyone is about
absent: the gate stays barred and a queue builds against it
